{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why is Socrates drop-kicking a donkey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What cosmic mysteries did Cleopatra's midnight sigils truly unveil?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is Einstein\u2019s selfie spree a quest to discover his true self?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is this a twisted history lesson or a cyberpunk rave in a parallel universe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into \ud83c\udfb5Rhythm Hotel\ud83c\udfb5 \u2014 where every tap launches a rhythm-fueled adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/2\u670816\u65e5__1_.gif?t=1745376096\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/\u8bc4\u8bba__9_.png?t=1745376096\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Brain-Melting Rhythm Challenges\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714Easy controls, chaotic beats! Every hit could trigger absurd plot twists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Ever-Escalating Difficulties\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714Each level cranks up the madness with unique rhythm mechanics. Precision? Reflexes? You\u2019ll need both.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Hilarious Storylines &amp; Over-the-Top Drama\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714Watch characters live their &quot;rhythm lives&quot; through slapstick animations and gloriously unhinged beats. Laughter guaranteed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Various Guests &amp; Signature Beat Skills\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714Unlock 20+ quirky guests, each with their own rhythm gimmicks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Beat Editor\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714Craft your own rhythm monstrosities! Our powerful level editor lets you mix music, madness, and mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">